{
  "dom_id": "questionExplanation-133790",
  "name": null,
  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "We need to isolate all terms with $s$ on one side of the equation. To do this, we add $2$ to both sides:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}10 & =3rs+2s-2 \\\\ 10+2 & =3rs+2s-2+2 \\\\ 12 & =3rs+2s\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we factor out $s$ in the expression on the right-hand side.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}12 & =3rs+2s \\\\ 12 & =s(3r+2)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we divide both sides by $(3r+2)$ to isolate $s:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}12 & =s(3r+2) \\\\ \\frac{12}{3r+2} & =\\frac{s(3r+2)}{3r+2} \\\\ \\frac{12}{3r+2} & =\\frac{s\\cancel{(3r+2)}}{\\cancel{3r+2}} \\\\ \\frac{12}{3r+2} & =s \\\\ s & =\\frac{12}{3r+2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n**Note:** This result assumes that $3r+2\\ne 0.$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"questionExplanation-133790\" class=\"questionExplanation\" style=\"display: block;\"><p>We need to isolate all terms with <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"3\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D460 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>s</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> on one side of the equation. To do this, we add <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"4\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> to both sides:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"5\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 11.112em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0.4em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 0px; padding-bottom: 0.4em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45F